    "title": "Ukraine to Sanction China Companies Aiding Russian Attacks",
    "text": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy is ordering sanctions on five Chinese companies. He says they're supplying parts used in Russian drones that targeted Kyiv this month. Russia used Shahed drones to attack Kyiv on July 4.\nAmong the companies are \"Central Asia Silk Road International Trade\" and \"Shenzhen Royo Technology.\"\nUkraine's security service previously confirmed that Chinese-made drone parts were found in drone wreckage after the attack last week.",
